nixos-needsreboot 0.1.10 reads kernel modules via the toplevel "kernel"
symlink, which recent nixpkgs points at .../bzImage instead of the derivation
with lib/modules — activation then fails with NotFound. Compare via the
"kernel-modules" symlink instead, falling back to "kernel" for pre-split
generations (e.g. rollback).
Upstream: https://github.com/thefossguy/nixos-needsreboot/pull/14 — drop this
patch once it merges.
